{"version":1,"content":"<p>剛於早前宣布與無綫約滿離巢的歌手谷婭溦，近日在社交平台的限時動態以黑底白字發文表示受騙，並表示已向執法部門報案，惟未有透露具體被騙經過及損失金額。</p><p>她接受東網訪時，指於某舖頭寄賣物品受騙：「間舖頭走咗佬，好彩唔多，7萬頭。</p><p>」&lt;br/&amp;g</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T15:20:18.919734+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T13:20:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T15:13:43.210253+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T15:13:43.210253+00:00","content_hash":"7574c46d8e11e04f6e3fefac6188626e699ad89932074cabd1073d60498b8a76","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}